WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
you guys did a bit of madness on the ads.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.200
The McCain's guys, they were really shocked

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.620
because they were like,

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.380
I've got like the franchisee was like,

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.680
oh yeah, you've done it 24 hours before he's coming.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.760
Like no one's turning up, da, da, da.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.560
I'm just like, okay.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.880
Even the McCain's guys are like,

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.880
yeah, I think we'll get a few, maybe five, 10 people coming.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.360
And then like three o'clock came, I think 2.30 came

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.880
and it was just a line down the street.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.400
Yeah, what the hell, what did you not do?

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.400
And then they were like, you guys are like

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.060
on a different level, like,

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:36.080
cause they done it with Pepe's before, with Darkest Man.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.900
And they got like 10, 15 people.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.160
And they were like, there's like a hundred people here.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.560
We went mad, man.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:43.760
Broke the door.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.320
They broke the hinges off the door.

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.320
Yeah, it was really good though, man.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.840
It was, it was, it was really good.
